<tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:shabbat/shacharit/shema/yotzer_or/festival/hameir"><tei:pb n="338" ed="1949 shabbat/shacharit/shema" facs="https://archive.org/download/PhilipBirnbaumHaSiddurHaShalemTheDailyPrayerBook1949/page/n362_medium.jpg"/><tei:p>In mercy thou givest light to the earth and to those who dwell on it; in thy goodness thou renewest the work of creation every day, constantly. How great are thy works, O Lord! In wisdom hast thou made them all; the earth is full of thy creations. Thou alone, O King, art ever exalted! Thou art lauded, glorified and extolled from days of old. Eternal God, show us thy great mercy! Lord of our strength, thou art our secure Stronghold, our saving Shield, our Refuge.</tei:p></tei:div>
